---
import { SITE, TOOLS, GUIDES } from '../config';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
 <div class="wrap">
 <div class="cols">
 <div>
 <h2>{SITE.name}</h2>
 <p>Free, unofficial fan-made calculators for the mobile game Harvest Town. Every tool runs entirely in your browser - nothing you type is sent anywhere.</p>
 <p><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> · <a href="/changelog/">What’s new</a> · <a href="/sitemap/">HTML sitemap</a></p>
 </div>
 <div>
 <h2>Tools</h2>
 <ul>
 {TOOLS.map((t) => <li><a href={`/tools/${t.slug}/`}>{t.name}</a></li>)}
 </ul>
 </div>
 <div>
 <h2>Guides &amp; legal</h2>
 <ul>
 {GUIDES.map((g) => <li><a href={`/guides/${g.slug}/`}>{g.name}</a></li>)}
 <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></li>
 <li><a href="/terms/">Terms</a></li>
 <li><a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a></li>
 </ul>
 </div>
 </div>
 <p class="footer-note">
 Unofficial fan tool. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by AVIDGamers or Dataverse Co., Limited.
 Harvest Town and its game assets are © their respective owners; crop, animal, fish and portrait images are served from the
 <a href="https://harvest-town.fandom.com" rel="noopener">Harvest Town Wiki</a> under fair use for identification.
 Game data verified {SITE.dataVersion}.
 </p>
 </div>
</footer>
